00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:33,160
You are elevating them from manual laborer to system manager.

99
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:38,000
And we actually see this exact elevation playing out at a massive scale in the Brookings

100
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
paper.

101
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Yes.

102
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,000
The 17 rooms initiative.

103
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,880
Yeah, they tested this vibe-teaming method on sustainable development goal 1.1, which

104
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,760
