128
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:57,840
Exactly.

129
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,880
I can design the product, write the back end, design the front end, and run the marketing.

130
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,520
I mean, it is a massive trap.

131
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:06,600
The solar flight assumes AI eliminates the need for human delegation, but it actually just

132
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:09,480
replaces human delegation with task juggling.

133
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:12,200
And that leads to what they call context switch hell.

134
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,800
So won't be through the mechanics of that.

135
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:19,880
Why does having an AI do the work cause a context switch problem for the human?

136
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:24,960
Well, because you are still the sole bottleneck for approval, imagine your day.

137
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:29,200
In the morning, you are in a high level strategic mindset negotiating a contract.

138
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,200
Okay.

139
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:34,680
At noon, you switch into architectural mode to review the database structure your AI agent

140
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,880
