141
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:40,400
In the evening, the agent throws an error on a specific API integration.

142
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:44,680
Now you have to drop down into the deepest, most granular level of syntax debugging.

143
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,840
Oh, well, that sounds exhausting.

144
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,840
It is.

145
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:52,360
You are forcing your brain to violently shift between macro strategy systems design and micro

146
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,520
execution multiple times a day.

147
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:57,640
And I'd imagine that is where the 95% problem is at head.

148
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,640
Yes.

149
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:01,800
Because the AI can write 90 to 95% of the code base in a matter of minutes.

150
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,200
It feels like magic.

151
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:05,600
But that last 5% is a nightmare.

152
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:11,520
It's the weird framework bugs, the logical hallucinations where the AI fundamentally misunderstood

153
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:15,840
