00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:45,840
Like, does this strategy account for the unwritten political dynamics of the region?

228
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:48,720
Does this copy have genuine emotional resonance?

229
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,720
Exactly.

230
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:55,600
Having incredible human taste and a sharp critical eye is basically useless if the underlying

231
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:59,360
AI system is secretly hallucinating variables or producing broken code.

232
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:03,560
I mean, I can't just be the reviewer if the thing I'm reviewing is fundamentally unstable.

233
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,560
Sure.

234
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:07,600
If I'm supposed to trust this assembly line, how do we technically structure these agents

235
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,600
so they aren't constantly handing me garbage?

236
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:14,160
Well, this is where we cross from psychology into a hardcore system architecture.

237
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:18,800
The software blueprints, particularly the Indo-German Venture Source, lay out the operational

238
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,280
engine required for this.

